  "description": "Compares two versions of a text segment and reports what was added, removed and left unchanged, by word or by character. Tags and placeholders are kept as units (useful for translation segments such as XLIFF or Trados Studio content). Returns the comparison units, an edit distance and word counts, ready to render as track changes. Targets .NET Framework 4.8 and .NET 8.",
