  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "2.2.0\n- Targets .NET Framework 4.8 again, alongside .NET 8 (2.1.0 targeted .NET 8 only).\n- Fixed: comparing sections no longer changes the caller's sections; adjacent text sections were joined into the first one, which also made the word counts and edit distance wrong.\n- Fixed: comparisons running at the same time with different settings could use each other's settings.\n- Fixed: a changed tab or line break is detected; tabs and line breaks are returned as they are; whitespace keeps its order when changes are grouped.\n- Fixed: whitespace was repeated when tags were excluded.\n- Fixed: emoji and other surrogate pairs are compared and returned whole.\n- Fixed: tag ids are kept, also when they contain quotes; a tag without text, null text and null input no longer throw.\n- Revision and Section.Revision are obsolete; sections with a Delete revision are still excluded, as in 2.0.x.\n- XML documentation for the whole public API. Only dependency: Newtonsoft.Json.",
